  "description": {
    "text": "Blister packs and boxed sets sold at Target and Toys \"R\" Us in October 2007, each with a pair of holofoil POP Series 5 cards found in no POP pack: cosmos holofoil Ho-Oh and Lugia, or Pelipper δ and Zangoose δ in the usual δ Delta Species mirror holofoil. The blisters held four booster packs (one each of Diamond & Pearl, EX Power Keepers, EX Crystal Guardians and EX Holon Phantoms) and an Energy coin; the boxes added a Theme Deck from a late EX Series expansion.",
